1
00:00:00,790 --> 00:00:03,500
(Penny:)- Hey.
- Oh, how'd it go last night?

2
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:05,680
(Raj:)Oh, you know.

3
00:00:05,680 --> 00:00:07,430
(Raj:)Same old, same old.

4
00:00:07,430 --> 00:00:09,260
(Raj:)Looked through a telescope,
saw some stars.

5
00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:10,680
(Raj:)Big whoop.

6
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:11,870
(Leonard:)Really?

7
00:00:11,870 --> 00:00:13,350
(Leonard:)You waited months
for time with that telescope.

8
00:00:13,350 --> 00:00:14,490
(Leonard:)What happened?

9
00:00:14,490 --> 00:00:17,070
(Raj:)Why? You writing a book?

10
00:00:17,070 --> 00:00:19,320
(Sheldon:)I'm going to propose
a hypothesis.

11
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:22,580
(Leonard:)Last night,
Raj accidentally made contact

12
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:25,210
(Sheldon:)with an alien civilization

13
00:00:25,210 --> 00:00:27,380
(Sheldon:)and has been ordered
by the United States government

14
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:29,420
(Sheldon:)to keep it a secret.

15
00:00:30,250 --> 00:00:31,390
(Raj:)Nothing happened.

16
00:00:31,390 --> 00:00:33,150
(Raj:)Can we please just
change the subject?

17
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:34,690
(Sheldon:)That sounds rehearsed.

18
00:00:34,690 --> 00:00:36,320
(Sheldon:)We are not alone.

19
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:38,160
(Raj:)Hey.

20
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:39,490
(Raj:)Hey.
Hello.

21
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:41,760
(Raj:)Hey.
Hey.

22
00:00:43,130 --> 00:00:45,500
(Leonard:)You get to play with
Raj's big telescope last night?

23
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:49,540
(Howard:)Whoa.

24
00:00:49,540 --> 00:00:51,360
(Howard:)Where did that come from?

25
00:00:51,360 --> 00:00:53,910
(Raj:)He never touched my telescope.

26
00:00:53,910 --> 00:00:55,480
(Howard:)Way to go shutting up.

27
00:00:55,480 --> 00:00:56,610
(Raj:)I did shut up. Now you shut up.

28
00:00:56,610 --> 00:00:57,980
(Sheldon:)Fine.
Thank you.

29
00:01:03,750 --> 00:01:05,720
(Wyatt:)I can't believe
you didn't call me this morning.

